<title>GREECE: Athens bourse OKs Loulis rights issue.</title>
<headline>Athens bourse OKs Loulis rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange approved the rights issue prospectus of Loulis Flour Mills, it said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Loulis will raise 1.6 billion drachmas with an of issue 1,445,304 new shares at 1,100 drachmas a share. The terms will be 35 new shares for every 100 outstanding.</p>
<p>Proceeds will finance investments in port storage facilities. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
